    options: ["2, 8, 7","2, 7, 8","2, 8, 8","8, 8, 1"],
    correct: 0,
    explain: "Kulit K maksimal 2, kulit L maksimal 8, sisanya di kulit M: 17 = 2 + 8 + 7."
  },
  {
    q: "Dua atom disebut isotop apabila memiliki kesamaan pada...",
    options: ["jumlah neutron","jumlah proton","nomor massa","jumlah elektron dan neutron"],
    correct: 1,
    explain: "Isotop = atom unsur sama (jumlah proton/nomor atom sama) tetapi jumlah neutron berbeda, sehingga nomor massanya berbeda."
